---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" lang="en" altLangHref="/privacybeleid/">
  <div class="page-intro">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="content-area">
    <main class="main-content entry anim-up" style="max-width:700px;">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </div>

      <h1>Privacy Policy of Pinso Benelux bvba</h1>
      <p>Pinso Benelux bvba values your privacy and ensures that your personal data is handled confidentially.</p>

      <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
      <p>
        Pinso Benelux bvba<br />
        Martelarenstraat 175<br />
        2400 Mol<br />
        Belgium<br /><br />
        VAT number: BE 0423.368.178<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:info@pinso.be" style="color:#2c5282;">info@pinso.be</a>
      </p>

      <h2>2. Personal data we collect</h2>
      <ul class="fancy-list">
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Phone number</li>
        <li>Message content</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Purpose of processing</h2>
      <ul class="fancy-list">
        <li>Responding to inquiries</li>
        <li>Providing information about our services</li>
        <li>Maintaining customer communication</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Legal basis</h2>
      <ul class="fancy-list">
        <li>Consent</li>
        <li>Legitimate interest</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
      <p>Data is stored for a maximum of 12 months after last contact.</p>

      <h2>6. Sharing data</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or share your data unless required by law.</p>

      <h2>7. Google reCAPTCHA</h2>
      <p>We use Google reCAPTCHA to prevent spam. Google may process data such as your IP address. For more information, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#2c5282;">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use functional cookies and possibly analytics cookies with consent.</p>

      <h2>9. Your rights</h2>
      <ul class="fancy-list">
        <li>Access to your data</li>
        <li>Correction of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Objection to processing</li>
        <li>Filing a complaint with the supervisory authority</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@pinso.be" style="color:#2c5282;">info@pinso.be</a>.</p>

      <h2>10. Security</h2>
      <p>We take appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your data against loss, misuse or unauthorised access.</p>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
